116
00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:52.083
Hey. what?

117
00:09:53.625 --> 00:09:55.207
Who let her watch <i>Water Cobra</i>?

118
00:09:55.208 --> 00:09:57.665
-I saw it at Janey's house.
