in the morning?

125
00:10:13.125 --> 00:10:14.915
-Yeah.
-Enjoy this.

126
00:10:14.916 --> 00:10:18.957
And use it as a bonding opportunity
with the prime minister.

127
00:10:18.958 --> 00:10:20.499
Please.

128
