was fish and chips.

132
00:10:30.166 --> 00:10:32.165
Look. you got off
on the wrong foot.

133
00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:34.749
-Sam's not a bad guy.
-It's not about bad or good.

134
00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.291
