135
00:10:38.083 --> 00:10:40.790
This is where you're supposed
to say. "Yes. he does."

136
00:10:40.791 --> 00:10:42.874
-He respects you.
-Way too late.

137
00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:45.624
Is a man who got 83 million
votes from the American people

138
00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:47.458
